WEBVTT

00:06.006 --> 00:11.928
-[bells chime]
-[chalk scrapes]

00:12.012 --> 00:16.516
-[man 1] No murderers in our schools!
-[protesters] Kick him out! Kick him out!

00:16.599 --> 00:18.727
[man 1] What did our children
do to deserve this?

00:18.810 --> 00:22.522
-[protesters] Kick him out!
-[man 1] No murderers in our schools!

00:22.605 --> 00:25.025
[protesters] Kick him out! Kick him out!

00:25.108 --> 00:27.485
-[man 2] That's him!
-[man 1] You bastard!

00:27.569 --> 00:28.862
[man 3] Please stand back.

00:28.945 --> 00:30.989
[photographer] Over here!
Mr. Cho! Look this way!

00:31.072 --> 00:33.283
-You bastard!
-[man 3] Get him out of there.

00:33.366 --> 00:34.743
[woman] This is outrageous!

00:35.243 --> 00:36.703
[somber music plays]

00:36.786 --> 00:40.915
[woman] How can you let our kids go
to school with a murderer? Kick him out!

00:42.125 --> 00:45.086
[man 4] The prisoner Cho Gyu-cheol
has shown remorse.

00:45.170 --> 00:49.299
In prison, he has abided by all the rules
and been an example to his co-detainees.

00:49.799 --> 00:53.887
Taking into consideration the young age
and that it was his first offense,

00:53.970 --> 00:57.182
the committee feels there is no risk to
public safety and releases him on parole.

00:57.265 --> 00:58.433
[lock buzzes]

01:05.106 --> 01:07.567
[protesters clamor]

01:24.375 --> 01:26.086
Sir, what are your thoughts

01:26.628 --> 01:28.505
about Gyu-cheol's release?

01:33.009 --> 01:34.010
I don't get it.

01:34.094 --> 01:36.513
He serves a minimum sentence
and then gets released?

01:36.596 --> 01:39.390
Then, once he's out,
his admission back to school

01:39.474 --> 01:41.059
is signed as if they were expecting it.

01:41.935 --> 01:45.355
Something's wrong.
It's all too smooth, like it was planned.

01:45.438 --> 01:47.649
Sir, this might be
worth looking into, right?

01:48.149 --> 01:50.318
The principal is responsible
for student admissions.

01:51.236 --> 01:53.238
Cho Gyu-cheol has paid for his crime,

01:53.321 --> 01:55.490
and we at the Bureau
do not have the authority

01:55.573 --> 01:57.784
to stop a student
who wishes to return to school.

02:00.120 --> 02:01.663
If I did stop him…

02:05.041 --> 02:06.668
that would be revenge.

02:10.672 --> 02:11.506
Where's Hwa-jin?

02:11.589 --> 02:14.175
He said he had to take care
of some personal business.

02:14.676 --> 02:16.803
[tense music plays]

02:16.886 --> 02:17.929
Whereabouts?

03:02.223 --> 03:03.433
[music fades]

03:03.516 --> 03:07.645
TEACH YOU A LESSON

03:08.396 --> 03:10.398
You look good in that uniform. Hm?

03:12.650 --> 03:16.362
No need to be nervous. I'm here
on official business for the Bureau.

03:17.280 --> 03:18.323
You're a test case.

03:18.406 --> 03:21.951
We want to see if kids like you can be
rehabilitated after time in jail.

03:22.035 --> 03:23.995
To see if you can handle civilian life.

03:24.078 --> 03:25.496
You know, to see whether

03:26.331 --> 03:28.875
you deserve another chance in life.

03:31.294 --> 03:32.253
I will

03:33.296 --> 03:34.464
do my best, sir.

03:34.547 --> 03:35.715
There's no need.

03:35.798 --> 03:37.008
Just live a normal life.

03:37.091 --> 03:39.135
Eat, sleep, breathe, study.

03:39.636 --> 03:40.762
Like a normal student.

03:42.972 --> 03:44.515
You think you can do that?

03:50.813 --> 03:52.565
I'm sure you understand what I mean.

03:54.484 --> 03:56.486
[haunting music plays]

03:59.072 --> 04:01.074
[footsteps echo]

04:13.169 --> 04:14.003
[music stops]

04:14.629 --> 04:17.423
[teacher] This is Gyu-cheol.
He's been readmitted to school.

04:17.507 --> 04:20.134
He's a little older than you,
so be nice to him.

04:20.218 --> 04:22.345
-Say hi.
-Okay.

04:23.554 --> 04:26.516
I hope that me being here
won't interrupt your studies.

04:28.142 --> 04:29.310
Nice to meet you.

04:30.478 --> 04:32.605
[applause]

04:37.318 --> 04:38.820
-[boy 1] What's that?
-Jong-su.

04:38.903 --> 04:40.071
The fuck are you doing?

04:40.154 --> 04:41.322
-[grunts]
-No, agh!

04:41.406 --> 04:44.409
I'm your teacher.
How could you? [groans jokingly]

04:44.492 --> 04:46.661
Seong-gu, please, call 911!

04:46.744 --> 04:49.831
-[boy 2] Here. Give it back to him.
-[Jong-su] Dumbass. You're no fun.

04:50.331 --> 04:51.791
Hey, man.

04:52.625 --> 04:54.585
Is it true that you killed a teacher?

04:54.669 --> 04:56.087
I heard it was a woman.

04:57.964 --> 05:00.925
Holy shit, you see that?
See that look in his eyes?

05:02.176 --> 05:03.428
You wanna stab me, don't you?

05:09.225 --> 05:11.644
I see that this killer wants to study.

05:15.231 --> 05:19.068
Oh, you think I'm being unfair, mm?
Want me to call you "big bro?"

05:20.111 --> 05:22.363
No need for that.
Call me whatever you want.

05:23.072 --> 05:25.366
-[Jong-su laughs]
-Damn, dude, you're cold.

05:25.450 --> 05:29.078
Just keep your head down. If you don't,
the Bureau will show up. Right?

05:29.162 --> 05:32.040
And then you're fucked. You understand?

05:33.583 --> 05:35.960
Mm. I'll do that. Thank you very much.

05:36.711 --> 05:38.755
Whoa. Time to go.

05:38.838 --> 05:40.923
-[Jong-su] Later, alligator!
-After a while, crocodile!

05:41.007 --> 05:42.967
[Jong-su] Don't forget your knife.
Fucking loser.

05:43.051 --> 05:45.219
-[boy 2] Seong-gu, let's go.
-Oh, okay!

05:51.601 --> 05:53.186
[suspenseful music plays]

06:32.517 --> 06:33.559
[Seong-gu] Let me see that.

06:33.643 --> 06:35.978
-Damn, that's awesome.
-[boy] See this?

06:36.062 --> 06:37.522
[Jong-su] Awesome my ass.

06:37.605 --> 06:39.190
[laughter]

06:39.899 --> 06:41.609
-Hey, Seong-gu?
-[Seong-gu] Yeah?

06:43.277 --> 06:45.363
-[boy] Holy shit! I did it!
-[Seong-gu] What?

06:45.446 --> 06:48.574
-[boy] I got to the next level!
-[Jong-su] No way. You're shitting me!

06:48.658 --> 06:50.576
MINISTRY OF EDUCATION

06:50.660 --> 06:53.704
-This is unbelievable!
-What is it?

06:53.788 --> 06:56.707
We just received a report
about a student who assaulted a teacher

06:56.791 --> 06:58.543
for telling him
not to use his phone in class.

06:58.626 --> 07:00.670
The student challenged him
to a Yatcha fight.

07:00.753 --> 07:02.505
"Yatcha fight?" What's that?

07:03.005 --> 07:05.800
It's a bare-knuckle fight
with no rules and no referees.

07:06.801 --> 07:10.471
Despite all our efforts,
this kind of thing keeps happening.

07:12.098 --> 07:14.517
Hm? What are you doing? Come on in

07:15.017 --> 07:18.020
-Sir, there's someone here to see you.
-Well, let them in.

07:18.896 --> 07:19.772
Okay.

07:23.943 --> 07:25.945
[tense music plays]

07:46.507 --> 07:47.758
[music fades]

07:47.842 --> 07:49.093
[Gang-seok] Mm.

07:50.303 --> 07:52.680
Cho Gyu-cheol, what, may I ask,
brings you here?

07:53.473 --> 07:55.808
Well, I've got something to report, sir.

07:55.892 --> 07:58.394
-You've got some nerve coming here!
-Whoa!

07:58.478 --> 08:00.646
[Gang-seok] This is the ERPB,

08:00.730 --> 08:03.691
and our Bureau is open to all students.

08:03.774 --> 08:05.109
Have a seat.

08:14.577 --> 08:16.078
Tell me. What brings you here?

08:17.371 --> 08:20.124
Sir, I've come here
to report a case of bullying.

08:21.584 --> 08:24.962
When I was in school, Ms. Choi told me
that part of being a student

08:25.046 --> 08:27.798
was to protect other students
who were having a hard time.

08:27.882 --> 08:30.885
-It was all part of growing up.
-Don't you dare mention her name!

08:30.968 --> 08:32.094
Inspector, please.

08:32.178 --> 08:34.096
Aren't you furious about this?

08:34.597 --> 08:35.973
Inspector Han-rim,

08:36.057 --> 08:39.185
I suggest that you go
get some fresh air. Hm?

08:40.853 --> 08:42.188
Han-rim, let's go.

08:45.650 --> 08:46.526
Bye.

08:49.362 --> 08:50.279
[door closes]

08:51.364 --> 08:52.865
Continue what you were saying.

08:54.033 --> 08:57.078
I'm sorry. I apologize.
I shouldn't speak of Ms. Choi.

09:06.170 --> 09:08.506
This is the student
I believe is being bullied.

09:08.589 --> 09:10.591
[tense music plays]

09:14.011 --> 09:17.014
[Han-rim] I don't trust him.
He's definitely up to something.

09:17.098 --> 09:20.851
Maybe. But his report,
well, it seemed pretty convincing.

09:21.561 --> 09:22.478
Deputy Bong is right.

09:22.562 --> 09:25.523
Gyu-cheol is a student like any other.
We should act accordingly.

09:26.107 --> 09:28.776
In that case,
Deputy Director Bong will be in charge.

09:28.859 --> 09:30.278
Yes, sir.

09:30.361 --> 09:31.737
No, it should be me, sir.

09:32.572 --> 09:34.574
Let me do it, Inspector.
You can't do this.

09:34.657 --> 09:36.993
Give me a good reason
why I shouldn't do it.

09:39.495 --> 09:42.415
-Aren't you going to stop him?
-Why should I?

09:43.457 --> 09:45.126
Why did the inspector cross the road?

09:45.209 --> 09:46.627
[laughs]

09:46.711 --> 09:48.087
You gotta be kidding.

09:48.170 --> 09:49.797
[Hwa-jin] I guess you've heard it before.

09:49.880 --> 09:53.551
This is not the time or the place
for your silly jokes.

09:55.219 --> 09:56.929
-Get out of here.
-Okay.

09:57.013 --> 09:58.889
What the hell
do you think you're doing laughing?

09:58.973 --> 10:00.349
I'll see you guys later.

10:00.850 --> 10:01.767
Geun-dae.

10:02.310 --> 10:03.603
-Come on!
-Not the right time.

10:03.686 --> 10:05.563
Don't try to stop me

10:05.646 --> 10:06.856
from crossing the road.

10:06.939 --> 10:07.940
[laughs]

10:08.024 --> 10:10.693
I can't believe I laughed.
Jeez, what's wrong with me.

10:10.776 --> 10:12.945
-Bong, stop it! This is not funny.
-[Geun-dae] I'm sorry.

10:13.029 --> 10:15.197
-[Han-rim laughs] I did it again.
-[Geun-dae] It's funny.

10:22.580 --> 10:24.332
[somber music plays]

10:24.415 --> 10:25.625
JINWON HIGH SCHOOL

10:25.708 --> 10:30.254
Do you mean Seong-gu from my class?
You're saying that he's being bullied?

10:32.006 --> 10:35.635
Wow. To be honest, I'm surprised.
I haven't noticed anything alarming.

10:36.510 --> 10:38.638
He's got a lot of friends,
and when I spoke to him,

10:38.721 --> 10:41.641
he said he was really enjoying
his time at Jinwon High.

10:41.724 --> 10:44.435
[boy] Next time in karaoke,
stop singing that song "Emergency Room!"

10:44.518 --> 10:46.437
-Hyeon-tae?
-Yeah?

10:47.521 --> 10:49.315
-Stop stealing my chips!
-[Jong-su] I'm hungry.

10:49.398 --> 10:50.441
Okay.

10:50.524 --> 10:51.692
[coughs]

10:52.568 --> 10:54.904
[Jong-su] Shit. What's going on? What?

10:55.404 --> 10:56.530
Hey, what the hell?

10:57.031 --> 10:58.449
-Huh?
-It's not loading.

11:01.118 --> 11:02.828
Where the fuck did Seong-gu go?

11:02.912 --> 11:04.121
[Seong-gu] Oh.

11:05.289 --> 11:06.165
Uh…

11:06.832 --> 11:09.502
Why are you so anxious?
I didn't mean to scare you.

11:10.002 --> 11:11.003
Uh…

11:11.837 --> 11:14.298
-You're from the Bureau, is that it?
-Mm.

11:14.799 --> 11:15.966
And do you know why I'm here?

11:16.801 --> 11:17.802
No, I've no idea.

11:17.885 --> 11:20.346
I was told there was
some bullying happening here.

11:21.263 --> 11:24.850
-I can tell you there's no bullying here.
-You mind if I take a look?

11:27.228 --> 11:28.104
Okay.

11:30.314 --> 11:31.774
-And your mouth.
-What?

11:31.857 --> 11:34.902
-Say, "Ah!" Come on.
-Ah. Ah. Ah.

11:35.736 --> 11:38.322
Mm. At least they don't beat you.

11:39.031 --> 11:40.700
Sir, it's not what you think.

11:41.617 --> 11:42.743
I have to go now.

11:43.327 --> 11:44.745
You're Mr. Wi-Fi?

11:45.913 --> 11:47.206
[tense music plays]

11:47.289 --> 11:51.419
My guess is you turn on your hot spot
so that the other kids can play games.

11:52.336 --> 11:53.629
Like a human Wi-Fi.

11:56.590 --> 11:59.635
You're always in the middle of the crowd
so they can get the signal.

11:59.719 --> 12:02.346
And you're always the first
to pull out your phone.

12:03.806 --> 12:07.393
I'm assuming you do that so the other kids
can connect to your hot spot.

12:09.270 --> 12:12.606
And you are the only one
with a power bank in your backpack.

12:13.107 --> 12:15.192
That way, Wi-Fi never shuts down.

12:22.158 --> 12:23.993
Now, you've got this all wrong.

12:24.493 --> 12:28.622
I really have to go. I'm serious.
Have a nice day. Bye.

12:30.124 --> 12:31.333
Hey, here he is.

12:31.417 --> 12:33.836
Seong-gu, what's up?
What are you doing here?

12:33.919 --> 12:38.340
I was doing nothing. I was just walking
around and this guy from the ERPB, he--

12:38.424 --> 12:42.011
-Son of a bitch. The ERPB.
-You should watch your language.

12:42.094 --> 12:44.180
What brings you to our school, Inspector?

12:44.930 --> 12:47.600
Oh! Now I get it.
You're here for Gyu-cheol.

12:47.683 --> 12:50.853
In fact, I'm here for you.
I was told you're quite the bully.

12:51.437 --> 12:53.355
-[boy] Me, a bully?
-[Hwa-jin] Mm.

12:54.940 --> 12:55.941
Who told you that?

12:56.025 --> 12:59.278
Nobody was bullied!
I said that nobody was!

12:59.779 --> 13:02.198
You can't just accuse
innocent people like that.

13:03.407 --> 13:05.242
Inspector, look what you've done to him.

13:05.326 --> 13:09.371
It's okay, Seong-gu. Relax, man.
Even the Bureau can make mistakes, okay?

13:09.455 --> 13:10.414
[chuckles]

13:11.832 --> 13:12.958
May we be excused now?

13:13.667 --> 13:14.585
Sure.

13:15.211 --> 13:17.421
-[boy] Have a lovely day, sir.
-[Hwa-jin] Mm.

13:17.922 --> 13:21.383
Let's go. Seong-gu,
you had me really worried back there.

13:21.467 --> 13:23.135
I thought you'd vanished on us.

13:24.553 --> 13:26.514
Why are you all nervous and sweaty, dude?

13:28.891 --> 13:32.353
-Hey, help me out here!
-[Jong-su] Dope! I got to legendary level.

13:33.854 --> 13:36.315
-[Hyeon-tae] Don't engage. Don't attack.
-[boy] Okay.

13:36.398 --> 13:37.775
[man] Hey, Geun-dae?

13:38.776 --> 13:41.570
-[Geun-dae] Yeah?
-You're Bong Geun-dae. I know you.

13:41.654 --> 13:43.364
-Oh yeah…
-[man] It's been forever.

13:43.447 --> 13:47.159
-How have you been? Everything okay?
-Fine, thanks. How about you?

13:47.243 --> 13:50.704
Hey, I heard you're a civil servant.
Someone told me where you work.

13:51.205 --> 13:52.957
-The ERPB, that was it.
-Hey, shh!

13:53.040 --> 13:55.167
[man] Yeah, the ERPB. That's really cool.

13:55.251 --> 13:57.795
Listen, I'll call you back later.
Sorry, I gotta go.

13:57.878 --> 13:59.630
Wait up! Bong Geun-dae!

13:59.713 --> 14:01.882
-[Jong-su] One of you, attack!
-[Hyeon-tae] I got you.

14:01.966 --> 14:02.800
Guys, let's go.

14:02.883 --> 14:05.928
Yeah, sure, after this game.
You got him? I'm on my way.

14:13.394 --> 14:16.105
-[Han-rim] Why are you back already?
-This way, come on.

14:16.188 --> 14:18.232
-[Han-rim] What's up?
-I think that I blew it.

14:18.315 --> 14:19.316
What's going on?

14:19.400 --> 14:21.777
-Put them on. Good.
-Why are you giving them to me?

14:22.820 --> 14:25.406
-Hey, what are you doing!
-Listen to me! Stop moving.

14:27.074 --> 14:28.742
Take this and put it in your ear.

14:28.826 --> 14:29.994
-Why?
-It's an earpiece.

14:30.077 --> 14:31.620
[Han-rim] Is that eye shadow?

14:31.704 --> 14:33.581
-What are you…
-[Geun-dae] Stay still!

14:34.081 --> 14:35.291
[intriguing music plays]

14:35.374 --> 14:36.625
There, that's good.

14:37.126 --> 14:38.377
Just remember one thing.

14:38.460 --> 14:39.670
You're a dork.

14:39.753 --> 14:41.922
And a dork never makes eye contact.

14:42.006 --> 14:43.215
A dork?

14:46.093 --> 14:48.012
-Fuck this shit.
-What the fuck? What's with you?

14:48.095 --> 14:50.347
I said let's fucking go, dumbass.
Something's not right.

14:50.431 --> 14:53.350
-What do you mean?
-You suck at this. Stop fucking around.

14:53.434 --> 14:54.977
-Okay, we'll leave.
-I said let's go!

14:55.060 --> 14:56.395
[gasping]

14:57.354 --> 14:58.230
[boy] What the f…

15:00.900 --> 15:04.653
Jeez, bitch, you fucking blind?
Why don't you watch where you're going?

15:05.362 --> 15:06.989
[Geun-dae] Don't look him in the eye!

15:09.450 --> 15:10.993
You're one lucky chick.

15:11.076 --> 15:14.580
Get the fuck out of my way. Don't let me
catch you here again. Move it!

15:15.289 --> 15:16.165
[boy sighs]

15:17.791 --> 15:20.002
[Jong-su] It's your fault
for being an asshole.

15:20.085 --> 15:22.379
[Geun-dae] Good job.
You did well controlling your emotions.

15:22.463 --> 15:24.048
That little son of a…

15:24.548 --> 15:27.259
[computer beeps]

15:27.760 --> 15:29.887
Testing… Ah, ah.

15:31.847 --> 15:34.016
I think I've cloned Chi-ho's voice.

15:34.099 --> 15:35.517
-Check it.
-[Hwa-jin] Mm.

15:37.394 --> 15:39.438
[Geun-dae and electronic Chi-ho]
Hey, it's me, Chi-ho.

15:39.521 --> 15:42.232
-Dude, can you give me the password?
-Ooh!

15:42.316 --> 15:43.859
-Oh!
-Shit!

15:43.943 --> 15:45.527
-[laughs]
-Make the call.

15:46.028 --> 15:47.988
Okay, calling Jang Seong-gu now.

15:48.072 --> 15:51.283
-I'm a bit nervous.
-[Hwa-jin] Don't worry. Just act natural.

15:51.367 --> 15:53.535
[cell phone dials]

15:53.619 --> 15:54.662
[Seong-gu] Hello?

15:56.121 --> 15:57.665
[Geun-dae as Chi-ho] It's me Chi-ho.

15:57.748 --> 16:00.793
I'd really appreciate it
if you could kindly give me the password.

16:00.876 --> 16:04.088
[Seong-gu] Chi-ho, is that really you?
It doesn't sound like you.

16:04.588 --> 16:06.173
-Who is this?
-Give me that.

16:09.551 --> 16:12.471
[Han-rim as Chi-ho] Listen to me,
dumbass. Who else do you think this is?

16:12.554 --> 16:14.139
Give me the fucking password!

16:14.223 --> 16:17.017
[Seong-gu] Sorry.
The password is, "W-I-F-I," Wi-Fi.

16:25.401 --> 16:29.029
The account belongs to Seong-gu,
and yet he doesn't have a profile.

16:29.113 --> 16:31.657
It looks like all those guys
are sharing the same account.

16:31.740 --> 16:33.951
[Geun-dae] I checked Seong-gu's account
on the food app.

16:34.034 --> 16:36.286
It includes a ton
of different names and addresses.

16:36.370 --> 16:38.455
Some of the orders are over 100,000 won.

16:38.539 --> 16:41.125
[Han-rim] More than 20 of these games
require paid subscriptions.

16:41.208 --> 16:43.502
None of that makes sense
unless he's been skipping class.

16:43.585 --> 16:45.754
There's a lot of e-scooter rentals.

16:46.505 --> 16:47.923
It says he's using one right now.

16:48.007 --> 16:50.884
The app says
a food delivery has just arrived.

16:50.968 --> 16:53.846
-[cell phone chimes]
-[Han-rim] Right now, he's playing online.

16:53.929 --> 16:57.349
It appears that Seong-gu
is capable of playing online

16:57.433 --> 17:00.269
while riding a scooter and eating
all at the same time.

17:01.395 --> 17:03.397
[intriguing music plays]

17:08.986 --> 17:10.612
Whoa!

17:10.696 --> 17:11.572
Oh!

17:12.281 --> 17:14.992
Do you actually have to imagine it first?
Seriously, Bong!

17:15.075 --> 17:16.952
So, this isn't just about the money?

17:17.036 --> 17:19.371
What did you find out
about the scam cases?

17:20.622 --> 17:24.501
I found this online page where victims
share information with each other.

17:24.585 --> 17:26.045
I looked up Seong-gu's name.

17:26.128 --> 17:29.506
It all refers to undelivered items,
eat-and-runs, and resale apps.

17:29.590 --> 17:31.008
These people are reporting fraud.

17:31.091 --> 17:34.011
So Seong-gu's friends posted fake listings
using his name,

17:34.511 --> 17:35.763
then take the money and run.

17:35.846 --> 17:39.141
But there's way too much activity
for this to be just one person.

17:46.565 --> 17:47.566
[music fades]

17:49.359 --> 17:50.319
[beeping]

17:50.986 --> 17:53.489
[cell phone rings]

17:54.990 --> 17:56.700
You're the fucker who scammed me.

17:57.201 --> 17:59.411
Hey, you scammed me out of my AirPods.

17:59.495 --> 18:02.706
Listen. It wasn't me.
Seriously, I didn't do anything, okay?

18:02.790 --> 18:05.000
Someone stole my account.
I'm telling you--

18:05.084 --> 18:06.710
-[groans]
-Piece of shit!

18:06.794 --> 18:08.003
I'm telling you, it wasn't--

18:08.087 --> 18:11.256
[man] I'm gonna kill you,
you fucking asshole. You hear me?

18:11.340 --> 18:14.384
Yeah? You son of a bitch!
You fucking bastard!

18:14.468 --> 18:16.929
I'm gonna kill your punk ass.
You think you can rip me off?

18:17.012 --> 18:19.807
You're a fucking thief!
Give me my money back!

18:20.432 --> 18:22.601
[Chi-ho inhales sharply] Shit!

18:22.684 --> 18:23.644
[Seong-gu winces]

18:24.228 --> 18:26.105
-[groans]
-[Chi-ho] You let yourself get caught.

18:26.688 --> 18:28.732
What the fuck, man? [laughs]

18:29.983 --> 18:30.859
[Chi-ho sighs]

18:33.403 --> 18:36.365
If I don't pay him back,
he's gonna hurt me, Chi-ho.

18:36.949 --> 18:37.825
So what?

18:37.908 --> 18:41.411
I'm really sorry to ask you,
but I was hoping you could help me out.

18:41.495 --> 18:43.789
-I don't have that kind of money.
-Tough luck.

18:44.331 --> 18:45.916
I don't have any money either.

18:46.625 --> 18:48.710
You can handle it. Hm?

18:48.794 --> 18:50.212
Chi-ho,

18:51.463 --> 18:52.422
I'm begging you.

18:52.506 --> 18:54.007
[Chi-ho] For fuck's sake.

18:55.968 --> 18:58.178
I promise I'll take care of this
as soon as I can.

18:58.262 --> 18:59.763
Yeah, okay, but when?

19:01.723 --> 19:03.016
Are you saying I'm a liar?

19:05.227 --> 19:07.437
No. Of course not. No.

19:07.521 --> 19:10.649
Seong-gu, just imagine one second
if I did nothing.

19:10.732 --> 19:13.735
All of this stuff
is under your name. Right?

19:13.819 --> 19:17.781
You're the only one who'd be screwed.
But it's okay. I said I'd take care of it.

19:19.241 --> 19:20.284
You should be thankful.

19:23.537 --> 19:27.499
Ma'am, my son has told me
that Chi-ho has been using his account

19:27.583 --> 19:31.044
to buy food, rent scooters,
and to buy gaming subscriptions.

19:31.837 --> 19:35.007
It's all there.
He's spent enormous sums of money.

19:36.508 --> 19:37.676
[woman] That's your story.

19:37.759 --> 19:41.388
I've asked Chi-ho to come home early
so he can explain his version.

19:41.471 --> 19:43.974
-[lock beeps, door opens]
-[tense music plays]

19:44.600 --> 19:45.726
[Chi-ho's mom] Is that you?

19:46.351 --> 19:47.311
Hey, Seong-gu.

19:47.811 --> 19:49.438
Sit down. It's okay.

19:50.689 --> 19:52.191
Did you just send this to my sister?

19:54.610 --> 19:56.528
[moaning on video]

19:56.612 --> 19:59.907
-You sent her that? You DM'd her?
-Oh my God! What is this?

19:59.990 --> 20:03.243
Seong-gu, was it you?
Did you send this filthy video to her?

20:03.327 --> 20:07.080
It wasn't me, Mom, I swear. I swear
I didn't. It was Chi-ho who did it.

20:07.164 --> 20:10.542
Are you saying that Chi-ho sent this filth
to his own little sister?

20:10.626 --> 20:13.045
-That's ridiculous!
-Are you out of your mind?

20:13.128 --> 20:14.671
-[Chi-ho's mom] This is horrendous.
-Mom!

20:14.755 --> 20:16.506
-I'm gonna call the police.
-It's not true.

20:16.590 --> 20:19.426
Please no, wait. It's my fault.

20:19.509 --> 20:22.804
I'm so sorry for troubling you.
I apologize on my son's behalf.

20:22.888 --> 20:24.139
I'm begging you. Forgive him.

20:24.223 --> 20:26.600
-I'm warning you.
-[Chi-ho's mom] It's absolutely…

20:26.683 --> 20:29.353
Next time, I'm gonna send it
to all the girls in our class.

20:29.436 --> 20:31.730
Don't you ever snitch on me again.

20:32.522 --> 20:35.234
-[Seong-gu's mom] It's a mistake.
-[Chi-ho] Ji-hyo, are you okay?

20:35.317 --> 20:38.570
Let's forget about it.
Sorry. Thank you, ma'am. I'm so sorry.

20:38.654 --> 20:40.614
-Let's go.
-[Chi-ho] Are you a pervert?

20:40.697 --> 20:43.575
-[Seong-gu] I didn't do it! I swear.
-[Seong-gu's mom] Shut up! Get out.

20:43.659 --> 20:44.910
-I didn't do anything!
-Goodbye.

20:44.993 --> 20:47.496
Are you okay? How are you feeling?

20:50.791 --> 20:51.708
Mm-hmm.

20:52.501 --> 20:53.460
You're right.

20:53.543 --> 20:56.296
[chuckles] Of course I'm right. Jeez.

20:56.380 --> 20:59.007
-[music fades]
-[cell phone buzzes]

20:59.591 --> 21:00.634
[Seong-gu] Chi-ho,

21:01.260 --> 21:02.678
is it okay if I answer it?

21:02.761 --> 21:06.223
You see I'm playing a game?
It's gonna lag if you take the call.

21:06.723 --> 21:07.641
[Seong-gu] It's my mom.

21:08.850 --> 21:11.311
Shit. Okay, go ahead.

21:12.771 --> 21:13.689
[Chi-ho sighs]

21:15.232 --> 21:16.108
Hi, Mom.

21:16.191 --> 21:18.819
[Seong-gu's mom] What the hell
is going on? What have you done?

21:19.987 --> 21:22.364
I can't believe how much you owe.

21:22.864 --> 21:26.159
The last time, when I paid your bills,
I said that was the end of it.

21:26.243 --> 21:28.495
And yet, how many times is it now?

21:28.578 --> 21:31.498
I just can't make sense of any of this.

21:33.458 --> 21:37.587
Can you explain it to me?
Don't you have anything to say? Huh?

21:38.088 --> 21:41.675
-Are you gonna tell me it's Chi-ho again?
-It wasn't me, Mom, honestly.

21:41.758 --> 21:45.345
After everything that you put me through,
you still lie to my face!

21:45.887 --> 21:49.558
Why are you doing this to me?
I don't understand why!

21:50.058 --> 21:51.226
[mom sobs]

21:51.310 --> 21:52.811
I… I can't take it.

21:52.894 --> 21:54.104
[mom cries]

22:01.653 --> 22:02.612
[sighs]

22:02.696 --> 22:04.906
[footsteps approaching]

22:17.419 --> 22:19.421
[somber music plays]

22:21.381 --> 22:22.424
[knocking on door]

22:32.017 --> 22:35.812
Sir, Seong-gu would like to tell you
about what Chi-ho has done to him.

22:36.980 --> 22:38.357
You'll tell him everything?

22:40.650 --> 22:41.568
Yeah.

22:42.152 --> 22:43.737
Gyu-cheol told me that

22:45.030 --> 22:45.989
I can trust you.

22:46.073 --> 22:47.574
That I can trust the Bureau.

22:55.707 --> 22:58.001
[Gyu-cheol] Are you afraid
the ERPB won't believe you?

23:04.966 --> 23:07.594
All I can tell you,
from my experience, is that

23:08.345 --> 23:10.222
if the Bureau existed

23:11.848 --> 23:13.141
two years ago…

23:18.021 --> 23:20.774
I'm sure that I wouldn't
have killed anyone.

23:22.901 --> 23:24.569
And that no one would have died.

23:25.821 --> 23:28.031
Inspector Na, he'll be different.

23:29.741 --> 23:31.660
He's just the same as Choi Ga-yun.

23:38.041 --> 23:40.502
HE USED MY IDENTITY ON VARIOUS WEBSITES
TO SCAM PEOPLE

23:40.585 --> 23:41.920
[music fades]

23:42.003 --> 23:43.046
Yeah?

23:45.090 --> 23:46.174
Excuse me.

23:46.675 --> 23:48.760
Uh, have you heard the news?

23:50.053 --> 23:51.763
The school board has been called.

23:53.974 --> 23:55.350
Lee Chi-ho has

23:55.851 --> 23:58.979
reported Seong-gu,
accusing him of bullying.

24:00.147 --> 24:00.981
What?

24:01.064 --> 24:03.066
[suspenseful music plays]

24:08.405 --> 24:10.574
SCHOOL VIOLENCE DELIBERATION COMMITTEE

24:12.868 --> 24:15.704
AFFECTED STUDENT

24:15.787 --> 24:18.915
ACCUSED STUDENT

24:21.751 --> 24:22.586
[music stops]

24:23.587 --> 24:26.006
Mr. Chairman, the ERPB
has no jurisdiction in this school

24:26.089 --> 24:28.300
and cannot play a part in this inquiry.

24:28.383 --> 24:29.384
I must ask that he leave.

24:29.468 --> 24:32.220
Well, in fact,
the Bureau received a report,

24:32.304 --> 24:36.224
and we are investigating similar events
that occurred at the same time.

24:36.308 --> 24:38.101
I am here simply to observe.

24:38.185 --> 24:40.770
-You shall not be allowed to speak.
-Right.

24:42.063 --> 24:45.609
In that case, the violence committee may
proceed to review this case of bullying

24:46.109 --> 24:47.652
at Jinwon High School.

24:47.736 --> 24:50.655
We'll begin by hearing a statement
from the victim's counsel.

24:51.198 --> 24:53.617
Even before the incident
was properly reported,

24:53.700 --> 24:58.038
Jang Seong-gu had been spreading false
rumors concerning my client, Lee Chi-ho,

24:58.121 --> 25:00.874
and called the ERPB,
effectively branding him a bully.

25:01.458 --> 25:04.586
Mr. Lee currently suffers
from severe psychological distress.

25:04.669 --> 25:07.088
We're submitting his psychiatric records
as evidence.

25:11.760 --> 25:13.887
DEPRESSIVE DISORDER
PANIC DISORDER

25:14.721 --> 25:17.933
We'll now hear from the accused.
Please make your statement.

25:22.187 --> 25:23.438
Um, well, I…

25:31.196 --> 25:32.405
None of this is fair.

25:35.075 --> 25:36.034
I am…

25:36.576 --> 25:37.786
I'm the victim here.

25:40.247 --> 25:43.083
Chi-ho and his friends,
they stole all my accounts.

25:44.084 --> 25:48.630
They used my ID to run scams,
to buy stuff, to order food deliveries,

25:48.713 --> 25:50.006
to play online games.

25:50.090 --> 25:51.341
[man] Do you have any evidence?

25:53.009 --> 25:55.470
You claim they stole it,
but do you have proof?

25:56.680 --> 25:57.639
I don't really--

25:57.722 --> 26:00.392
As you can see, the accused
has no evidence to back his claim.

26:01.142 --> 26:04.563
Mr. Chairman, I would argue
that these claims are utterly false

26:04.646 --> 26:06.523
and constitute character defamation.

26:08.984 --> 26:10.026
[sighs]

26:10.735 --> 26:12.487
[tense music plays]

26:19.953 --> 26:21.997
I play games at an internet cafe.

26:22.497 --> 26:25.250
But at the same time,
my account shows people renting scooters,

26:25.333 --> 26:28.253
people ordering food, selling stuff,
which goes to prove--

26:28.336 --> 26:30.797
You're right. Lee Chi-ho
has mentioned borrowing your account

26:30.880 --> 26:32.507
several times for urgent needs.

26:32.591 --> 26:35.343
-It wasn't just a few times!
-Mr. Jang, please be quiet.

26:36.886 --> 26:38.221
Don't interrupt.

26:41.391 --> 26:44.686
My client borrowed your account and ID
once or twice to stream games,

26:44.769 --> 26:48.523
and used the account to rent a bike
on occasion when he had no other choice.

26:48.607 --> 26:51.443
He acknowledges this
and has already paid back what he owed

26:51.526 --> 26:53.278
because my client
wanted to help his friend.

26:53.361 --> 26:55.113
He never paid me anything at all.

26:55.196 --> 26:56.990
[man] You might want
to check your account.

27:04.164 --> 27:05.332
TRANSACTION HISTORY

27:05.415 --> 27:07.709
LEE CHI-HO - LOAN REPAYMENT
DEPOSIT 1,000,000 WON

27:16.885 --> 27:20.472
My client paid his debts. In return he has
suffered grievous psychological stress.

27:20.555 --> 27:22.057
He's been labeled a bully.

27:22.140 --> 27:25.477
He's been ostracized from his friends,
based on false accusations.

27:25.560 --> 27:26.936
This is not simply slander.

27:27.020 --> 27:29.606
My client's very future
is being threatened by these lies.

27:30.649 --> 27:34.944
This is a vile and coordinated attempt
to destroy my client's reputation.

27:35.945 --> 27:39.032
Rest assured we are not seeking
criminal charges against the accused.

27:39.115 --> 27:41.534
However, based on the psychiatric reports

27:41.618 --> 27:44.788
and the fact that his ability
to pursue his studies is impeded,

27:45.288 --> 27:48.041
we feel that financial compensation
would be a suitable settlement.

27:48.124 --> 27:50.293
Financial compensation?

27:51.961 --> 27:53.380
How much do you want?

27:53.463 --> 27:57.342
Mrs. Lee is a truly admirable woman
with a big heart.

27:57.425 --> 28:00.303
Considering that the events
happened between children,

28:00.387 --> 28:03.098
she would accept a sincere apology
as adequate settlement.

28:04.099 --> 28:06.101
Mrs. Jang, will you accept the proposal?

28:12.482 --> 28:14.734
[indistinct chatter]

28:14.818 --> 28:16.820
Mrs. Lee, excuse me.

28:17.445 --> 28:19.239
Thank you for your understanding.

28:20.156 --> 28:22.242
I'll make sure this never happens again.

28:22.325 --> 28:25.829
I appreciate how understanding
and compassionate you've been.

28:26.413 --> 28:30.333
Chi-ho, please forgive him. All right?

28:30.417 --> 28:33.586
I am truly sorry for all he has done
and what he has put you through.

28:35.171 --> 28:36.840
[Hwa-jin] That's the situation.

28:36.923 --> 28:38.717
Yes, sir, understood.

28:39.426 --> 28:40.343
[bangs table]

28:41.094 --> 28:42.095
-[grunts]
-[gasps]

28:42.929 --> 28:44.681
-Can you believe this?
-Huh?

28:44.764 --> 28:47.350
Chi-ho's guilty, yet he's the one
who convenes the committee

28:47.434 --> 28:49.519
and he even hires a fancy lawyer.

28:50.228 --> 28:53.356
I've heard there are lawyers
who specialize in these types of cases.

28:53.440 --> 28:55.150
In fact, they hand out manuals.

28:55.942 --> 28:58.319
Step one.
Be the first to file a complaint.

28:58.403 --> 29:00.989
That way, you become the victim.
Step two, hit back.

29:01.072 --> 29:04.117
That way, it's a fight, not bullying.
And other tips like that.

29:04.200 --> 29:06.870
So, what's the point
in having a committee? Right?

29:07.370 --> 29:10.165
The point of having a hearing,
I thought, was to discover the truth.

29:10.248 --> 29:13.168
I know. But getting to the truth
isn't that easy.

29:13.251 --> 29:15.628
They learn about the case,
meet the students briefly,

29:15.712 --> 29:18.840
and have to reach a decision,
all of this in just one day.

29:19.340 --> 29:21.801
So they take a quick look
at the evidence provided

29:21.885 --> 29:24.846
and decide that both sides were at fault,
or that nobody is.

29:25.346 --> 29:28.600
The committee basically
cannot discover the truth.

29:28.683 --> 29:30.852
Ugh! So, what can we do?

29:30.935 --> 29:32.479
[yells] What can we do?!

29:32.562 --> 29:34.564
[suspenseful music plays]

29:54.417 --> 29:56.336
SEONG-GU'S IPHONE

30:06.387 --> 30:08.014
SEONG-GU'S IPHONE, WEAK CONNECTION

30:17.273 --> 30:21.945
SEONG-GU'S IPHONE, STRONG CONNECTION

30:32.413 --> 30:33.581
[music fades]

30:35.416 --> 30:36.417
[sniffling]

30:41.214 --> 30:42.048
[sniffling]

30:43.466 --> 30:44.384
[whimpers]

30:49.472 --> 30:51.099
[sniffles]

30:53.268 --> 30:54.519
[Hwa-jin] So here you are.

30:58.231 --> 31:00.191
[Hwa-jin sighs]

31:03.361 --> 31:05.405
[somber music plays]

31:17.834 --> 31:19.627
[cries]

31:24.799 --> 31:26.885
Seong-gu, you can cry all that you want.

31:27.886 --> 31:29.304
Don't keep it inside.

31:34.976 --> 31:36.853
'Cause if you keep it inside,

31:38.229 --> 31:40.231
then no one will know you're crying.

31:40.315 --> 31:41.441
[cries]

31:42.358 --> 31:43.818
[Hwa-jin] If you keep silent,

31:44.777 --> 31:47.196
then no one will know you've been wronged.

31:48.698 --> 31:49.991
And if you keep hiding your pain,

31:50.074 --> 31:52.660
they will never know
how much wrong they've done.

31:53.995 --> 31:56.289
[cries]

31:59.292 --> 32:00.919
Is this how you want to live?

32:01.586 --> 32:03.004
[cries]

32:16.643 --> 32:18.770
Well, then, I'll see you around.

32:30.698 --> 32:34.994
It's not fair! It's so unfair.
I don't deserve this!

32:35.078 --> 32:37.580
[sobs]

32:42.418 --> 32:47.298
I told the police about what happened.
I told my parents. I told my teachers.

32:47.799 --> 32:49.884
But no one believes me. No one!

32:50.385 --> 32:53.721
And I know the guys were being nice to me
just to use me,

32:53.805 --> 32:55.556
but they were all I had!

32:55.640 --> 32:59.435
They were the only friends I had.
And they liked me!

32:59.519 --> 33:01.813
[cries]

33:01.896 --> 33:05.650
Chi-ho said that he would come clean
and tell everyone.

33:06.150 --> 33:10.029
He said that he'd tell them
about how he used my accounts.

33:10.613 --> 33:13.658
But he kept putting it off,
acting like it was nothing.

33:13.741 --> 33:15.827
And now he's saying I'm guilty!

33:16.953 --> 33:20.248
Now everyone will think that I am a liar.
That I am a bully.

33:21.124 --> 33:22.125
It's true!

33:22.625 --> 33:25.878
Nobody believes me. My life is over!

33:26.629 --> 33:32.677
[sobs]

33:40.143 --> 33:41.853
Seong-gu, I still believe you.

33:48.443 --> 33:50.028
I'm here for you, Seong-gu.

33:55.616 --> 33:57.702
You can trust the ERPB.

34:07.462 --> 34:09.213
[cries]

34:15.636 --> 34:16.679
[music fades]

34:19.015 --> 34:20.725
[funky music plays]

34:25.563 --> 34:26.522
[sighs]

34:26.606 --> 34:27.440
Ready.

34:29.067 --> 34:31.277
-[Geun-dae] Don't forget the key chains.
-[Han-rim] Yeah.

34:31.944 --> 34:34.072
Mm. I have some here.

34:34.155 --> 34:35.364
Let's see…

34:36.824 --> 34:38.576
Do I have to use all of them?

34:38.659 --> 34:40.953
Do what I tell you to do
and you'll be fine.

34:42.205 --> 34:43.289
I'm ready!

34:45.333 --> 34:47.210
[Geun-dae] Watch out! They're coming!

34:47.293 --> 34:49.670
Damn it. We don't have Wi-Fi anymore.

34:49.754 --> 34:51.589
What do we do without our access point?

34:52.215 --> 34:55.426
Don't worry. All we have to do
is find another human Wi-Fi.

34:55.510 --> 34:57.678
[Han-rim] Ah, you're so cute!

34:57.762 --> 35:00.640
-I found this pretty one next to you.
-[Chi-ho] Well, well.

35:00.723 --> 35:03.476
-I won't hurt you. Don't worry.
-Hey, dork from the café

35:03.559 --> 35:06.062
You soaked my shirt! Remember?

35:09.690 --> 35:10.983
Hi there, guys.

35:11.067 --> 35:14.153
What do you think you're doing?!
You're supposed to be scared. Be a dork.

35:15.279 --> 35:16.239
Good morning.

35:16.322 --> 35:17.698
You owe me money, kid.

35:17.782 --> 35:20.660
Yeah, no problem.
For th… the dry cleaning?

35:21.244 --> 35:22.078
[chuckles]

35:23.830 --> 35:26.249
It's okay.
You can pay me back later. No worries.

35:27.208 --> 35:29.418
-You're new here, right?
-Uh-huh.

35:29.919 --> 35:32.797
Well, since it's your first day,
why not let me show you around?

35:32.880 --> 35:34.090
-Are you sure?
-[Chi-ho] Yeah.

35:34.173 --> 35:36.551
-I'd really like that.
-[Chi-ho] You should lose this though.

35:36.634 --> 35:38.219
-Done.
-But I really like flowers.

35:38.302 --> 35:40.179
[Chi-ho] She really doesn't have a clue.

35:40.721 --> 35:42.640
[Jong-su] Not too bright
and not too pretty.

35:43.808 --> 35:45.268
I don't believe it!

35:46.102 --> 35:47.895
You're in the same class with us?

35:48.396 --> 35:49.814
-[Chi-ho gasps]
-Wow. [chuckles]

35:49.897 --> 35:51.816
We can hang out together.

35:53.151 --> 35:56.487
-Are you for real?
-Of course. Why not? [laughs]

35:57.405 --> 35:58.239
[Geun-dae] Stop!

35:58.990 --> 36:02.201
You're a dork. You can't walk
in front of them! Let them go in first.

36:02.285 --> 36:03.619
[intriguing music plays]

36:03.703 --> 36:06.873
-Please, after you guys.
-[laughs] So nice of you.

36:06.956 --> 36:08.082
[laughs]

36:13.337 --> 36:14.338
[yelps]

36:14.422 --> 36:17.758
[Jong-su] Oh, I'm so sorry!
You gotta watch where you step, girl.

36:17.842 --> 36:21.345
-[Hyeon-tae] You're being a dickhead.
-It must be a case of first day jitters.

36:21.429 --> 36:22.972
Did you hurt yourself?

36:23.973 --> 36:25.016
You look okay.

36:26.559 --> 36:28.019
[chuckles]

36:28.895 --> 36:31.772
[Geun-dae] Inspector Rim, easy!
You're on a mission. Stay focused. Relax.

36:31.856 --> 36:32.899
Calm down, okay?

36:33.399 --> 36:35.401
[tense music plays]

36:37.486 --> 36:39.155
[chuckles] I'm fine, thanks.

36:39.238 --> 36:40.865
Thank you for worrying about me.

36:40.948 --> 36:43.117
[laughs] No worries, it's fine.

36:43.201 --> 36:44.994
Jeez, that scared the shit out of me.

36:45.077 --> 36:48.039
If you want to thank me,
can I use your Netflix account?

36:48.122 --> 36:50.458
[intriguing music plays]

36:53.085 --> 36:56.339
These are my accounts for Netflix,
streaming services and gaming.

36:56.923 --> 37:00.051
You can choose whichever level
of League of Legends you prefer.

37:00.134 --> 37:01.594
[Jong-su] Whoa!

37:01.677 --> 37:03.554
That's pretty fucking serious man!

37:03.638 --> 37:04.847
[Jong-su chuckles]

37:04.931 --> 37:07.016
Were you the human Wi-Fi at your school?

37:07.099 --> 37:10.895
Is that what you call it here? Because
we called it "hot spot" in my school.

37:10.978 --> 37:12.188
Hot spot, nice.

37:12.271 --> 37:15.524
And if the Wi-Fi signal is too weak here,
just let me know, okay?

37:15.608 --> 37:17.860
I can connect everyone with
this router. Use this.

37:17.944 --> 37:19.612
That's the password and ID.

37:19.695 --> 37:23.658
And I have, um, some stuff
if your battery's running low.

37:23.741 --> 37:26.118
I have this superfast portable charger,

37:26.202 --> 37:29.372
and all these cables
for all types of phones. Let me show you.

37:30.331 --> 37:33.376
See that? That's why the world
needs people with experience.

37:33.459 --> 37:35.169
They're prepared and know their stuff.

37:36.254 --> 37:37.129
Wow!

37:37.213 --> 37:40.508
Uh, if you give me your phones,
I can charge them before class.

37:40.591 --> 37:41.968
Yeah, good idea.

37:42.468 --> 37:44.136
Thanks. Here.

37:44.887 --> 37:46.722
Can you unlock it, please?

37:46.806 --> 37:49.642
-Yeah.
-I can connect them to the hot spot too.

37:50.393 --> 37:53.312
Thank you. Thank you very much. Thank you.

37:53.896 --> 37:56.065
[Chi-ho] Wow! How did she
get to this level of Legends?

37:56.148 --> 37:58.818
-[Jong-su] Hey, the mithril's mine!
-[Hyeon-tae] Go ahead, take it.

37:58.901 --> 38:00.903
[Chi-ho] Do you think she's that good?

38:00.987 --> 38:03.447
I guess she must be
better than you, Jong-su!

38:03.531 --> 38:04.365
[Hyeon-tae laughs]

38:04.448 --> 38:05.658
You just got beat, dude.

38:05.741 --> 38:06.575
[laughter]

38:06.659 --> 38:08.327
[Chi-ho] By a girl. Whatever.

38:08.411 --> 38:09.745
[indistinct chatter on video]

38:09.829 --> 38:10.913
[rock music plays]

38:13.624 --> 38:14.750
ACCOUNT ACTIVE ON ANOTHER PC

38:14.834 --> 38:17.545
[Jong-su] The fuck?
Who the hell is using my account?

38:18.421 --> 38:21.841
-[Hyeon-tae] Check your login history.
-[Jong-su] What the fuck! Colombia?

38:21.924 --> 38:23.884
There's some bastard in Colombia
using my account!

38:23.968 --> 38:25.136
You got your ass hacked.

38:25.219 --> 38:28.306
What the fuck? This guy's
trying to charge stuff to my account!

38:28.889 --> 38:31.475
-He's fucked now! No way out.
-[Jong-su] Oh shit, I'm screwed!

38:31.559 --> 38:34.687
"Hey dude, stop sending me
these stupid links, you dumbass!"

38:34.770 --> 38:37.315
"You don't have better things to do?
Spam! Well, fuck this shit!"

38:37.398 --> 38:38.316
Call him a douche.

38:38.399 --> 38:39.942
Nobody uses "douche" anymore.

38:40.026 --> 38:41.402
[laughs] For real?

38:41.485 --> 38:42.528
SPAMS ARE SO DAMN ANNOYING

38:42.611 --> 38:44.864
What the fuck?
Someone's using my number to send spam!

38:45.614 --> 38:46.741
MOM

38:46.824 --> 38:49.035
Hi, Mom. It wasn't me.
What are you talking about?

38:49.118 --> 38:52.455
-I'd never send you a link to a porn site!
-Moving on to the next level.

38:52.538 --> 38:54.457
[Hyeon-tae] Why don't you believe
your own son?

38:56.500 --> 38:58.294
I've logged into Chi-ho's account.

38:58.377 --> 39:01.505
This game has a pretty strict
profanity tolerance policy.

39:01.589 --> 39:04.759
He'll be suspended
depending on the level of profanity.

39:04.842 --> 39:08.929
Han-rim, swear as badly as you can.
Get him suspended for as long as possible.

39:11.390 --> 39:13.267
-Write this down.
-Give me a second.

39:13.351 --> 39:17.355
You son of a bitch, you brainless scumbag.
What kind of a fucker does that shit?

39:17.438 --> 39:19.648
When God was giving out brains,
he must've skipped you.

39:19.732 --> 39:22.526
Dude, stop being a bitch.
Just lie down and die. Just die, dumbass!

39:22.610 --> 39:24.487
You think you're hot,
but you don't know shit.

39:24.570 --> 39:26.947
Who the fuck made you king dick?
Dick, dick, dick!

39:27.031 --> 39:29.325
You pull that shit on me again,
you are dead!

39:29.408 --> 39:31.452
I will eat your fucking liver. Got that?

39:31.535 --> 39:33.579
-Ass!
-Perfect. Don't stop. Go on!

39:33.662 --> 39:35.456
You motherfuckers.
Gonna blow your head off.

39:35.539 --> 39:37.917
I will rip your eyeballs out
and shit in your sockets.

39:38.000 --> 39:40.252
I'm gonna break your fingers
and use them as chopsticks!

39:40.336 --> 39:43.255
I will deep-fry your balls
and smash them against the fucking wall.

39:43.339 --> 39:45.174
Squish, squish! Go ahead and make my day.

39:45.257 --> 39:48.219
I will stick my arm down your throat
and rip your fucking tonsils out!

39:52.473 --> 39:54.392
-[Chi-ho] What the fuck?
-What's up?

39:54.475 --> 39:58.979
No way! What the hell's going on?
Why the hell does it say 300 years?

40:00.648 --> 40:01.774
2,500 WON CHARGED

40:01.857 --> 40:03.526
EXTRA 50 MINS
SURCHARGE: 10,000 WON

40:05.736 --> 40:07.071
Shit.

40:07.154 --> 40:08.406
OUTSIDE SERVICE AREA: 22,000 WON

40:09.073 --> 40:12.326
What the fuck? No!
Son of a bitch! You crazy bastard!

40:13.452 --> 40:14.745
Whoa, what's up with you?

40:14.829 --> 40:16.372
I'm gonna kill this asshole.

40:19.959 --> 40:21.043
I got you!

40:22.002 --> 40:22.837
Whoa!

40:36.559 --> 40:38.060
You gotta be kidding me!

40:38.727 --> 40:40.729
Oh, for fuck's sake, man.

40:40.813 --> 40:41.939
I hate you!

40:42.022 --> 40:42.857
[music fades]

40:42.940 --> 40:44.567
[panting]

40:44.650 --> 40:47.027
-[man 1] We found it!
-[man 2] It's really here!

40:47.653 --> 40:49.155
He left it. Check the plates.

40:49.989 --> 40:51.449
[man 1] It should be 8-7-2-9.

40:51.532 --> 40:53.951
-What the…
-[man 1] It's practically brand new!

40:54.034 --> 40:55.911
-[man 2] Fucking A man!
-[both laugh]

40:55.995 --> 40:58.330
Hey, you! What the fuck are you…

40:58.831 --> 41:00.666
What the… What are you doing to my bike?

41:00.749 --> 41:03.544
-It's supposed to be free.
-A free bike? You outta your fucking mind?

41:03.627 --> 41:06.130
What the fuck, man?
You're the one who posted it.

41:06.213 --> 41:08.799
[Chi-ho] Fuck! Who the hell
posted this from my account?

41:08.883 --> 41:09.967
[rock music plays]

41:10.050 --> 41:12.344
That's not my problem, loser.
Now off you go.

41:12.428 --> 41:15.556
Don't touch me! Fuck you.
Just give me my bike. Now fuck off!

41:15.639 --> 41:17.141
-[Chi-ho gulps]
-Little son of a bitch!

41:17.224 --> 41:20.352
No! Wait a minute! Listen to me, will you?

41:20.436 --> 41:22.980
Somebody has hacked into my account.
It wasn't me.

41:23.063 --> 41:25.274
Well, then go and find him,
bring him to us,

41:25.357 --> 41:28.277
or else I'm gonna wipe
that ridiculous smile off your face.

41:29.069 --> 41:29.987
[music stops]

41:31.864 --> 41:34.074
This is all your fault, you bitch!

41:34.700 --> 41:37.495
You asked me to unlock my phone.
You did all this!

41:38.662 --> 41:39.914
Tell me the fucking truth!

41:40.539 --> 41:44.627
-[gasps] Will you let go of me first?
-Come clean to me and maybe I'll be nice.

41:46.378 --> 41:49.507
-Let go of me and maybe I'll be nice.
-What?

41:53.552 --> 41:54.553
[rock music plays]

41:55.596 --> 41:57.264
[Chi-ho grunts]

41:57.348 --> 41:59.183
Wh… what the fuck! [gasps]

42:00.351 --> 42:03.187
-Yeah, it was me who did it.
-Are you out of your mind?

42:03.270 --> 42:05.564
Do you have any idea
how much shit you put me through?

42:07.358 --> 42:09.193
How much shit are we talking about?

42:09.693 --> 42:13.489
Enough so that you'd prefer to die
rather than come back to school, huh?

42:16.075 --> 42:17.910
I haven't even started yet.

42:17.993 --> 42:19.453
You fucking…

42:24.124 --> 42:25.125
[Chi-ho groans]

42:26.877 --> 42:29.547
-You're gonna pay for this, bitch!
-No! Please stop!

42:30.297 --> 42:32.049
-[Chi-ho gasps]
-Give me a second.

42:32.633 --> 42:35.094
My… [clears throat]
…throat's beginning to hurt.

42:38.597 --> 42:41.433
Someone, help! Save me! Help me!

42:41.517 --> 42:44.311
-Hey! What are you doing?
-Don't hurt me! I'm so sorry!

42:44.395 --> 42:46.897
Please! Someone help me!

42:47.898 --> 42:48.857
What's going on?

42:49.942 --> 42:51.777
It's nothing. Okay?

42:51.860 --> 42:52.695
[music stops]

42:52.778 --> 42:53.696
[Han-rim whimpers]

42:54.572 --> 42:56.490
Ready for a committee meeting, Chi-ho?

42:57.950 --> 42:59.326
[whimpers]

42:59.410 --> 43:00.369
[students gasp]

43:00.452 --> 43:02.621
I didn't do anything.
She's the one who did it!

43:02.705 --> 43:04.498
She's a complete nutjob!

43:04.582 --> 43:07.751
[Han-rim] Someone help me! I'm scared!
Help me, I'm begging you.

43:07.835 --> 43:09.670
SCHOOL VIOLENCE DELIBERATION COMMITTEE

43:09.753 --> 43:13.007
[lawyer] Mr. Lee is not the bully here.
He's actually the victim.

43:13.507 --> 43:16.969
This new student is entirely responsible.
This person hacked into his phone,

43:17.052 --> 43:20.973
got his game account suspended, and
committed fraud by posting items for sale.

43:21.056 --> 43:23.559
Mr. Lee, do you have any evidence
to support this claim?

43:23.642 --> 43:26.312
I'm the victim here.
Why do I have to prove it?

43:26.395 --> 43:28.314
-Ask her, that new student.
-Quiet. Shh.

43:29.189 --> 43:30.274
Excuse me.

43:32.401 --> 43:34.403
[intriguing music plays]

43:34.987 --> 43:35.821
[scoffs]

43:41.994 --> 43:44.788
Our apologies for being late.

43:45.998 --> 43:47.750
We had to see a doctor.

43:47.833 --> 43:48.792
AFFECTED STUDENT

43:49.376 --> 43:50.210
[exhales]

43:50.294 --> 43:54.089
I'd also like to apologize on behalf of
the victim's lawyer who has been delayed,

43:54.173 --> 43:55.257
so I'll be replacing him.

43:55.341 --> 43:58.719
You're not a lawyer. What gives you
the right to represent anyone?

43:58.802 --> 44:01.180
With power of attorney,
I have the right. Mm.

44:04.099 --> 44:05.643
-For the record.
-[Hwa-jin] Thank you.

44:05.726 --> 44:08.604
Who's the fool of a lawyer
who signed that? Give me his name.

44:08.687 --> 44:10.064
It'll be my pleasure.

44:10.648 --> 44:11.732
I'm sure you recognize him.

44:11.815 --> 44:12.650
[gasping]

44:12.733 --> 44:14.109
It's Minister Choi from the ERPB.

44:14.193 --> 44:17.571
For those of you who don't know,
Minister Choi is also a lawyer.

44:17.655 --> 44:19.907
He's a full member of the Bar Association

44:19.990 --> 44:22.451
and has served
on various judicial committees.

44:22.534 --> 44:25.579
Regardless, the fact that the Bureau
participates at this hearing

44:25.663 --> 44:26.914
is an abuse of its power.

44:27.706 --> 44:30.042
We have an official document
from the Minister.

44:30.542 --> 44:32.836
This document confirms
that all school violence committees

44:32.920 --> 44:36.173
now fall under the remit of the ERPB,
for your information.

44:36.674 --> 44:40.386
Well, then, Inspector, I propose
that we begin today's hearing immediately.

44:40.469 --> 44:41.387
Mr. Chairman.

44:41.470 --> 44:43.013
I believe it is quite obvious

44:43.097 --> 44:47.267
how poorly Mr. Lee Chi-ho has treated
the new student, Miss Im Han-Rim.

44:47.351 --> 44:49.228
Her traumas are self-evident.

44:49.311 --> 44:51.188
Poor girl. Look, she's drooling.

44:51.271 --> 44:54.942
Right from the start,
she was branded a dork and an outcast.

44:55.025 --> 44:57.778
What should have been a positive
experience soon became a nightmare.

44:57.861 --> 45:00.197
-It's okay, you can give it another try.
-[mumbles]

45:00.280 --> 45:03.534
She now struggles with significant
mental health issues and emotional damage.

45:03.617 --> 45:05.160
You gotta be kidding me!

45:05.244 --> 45:07.079
Come on, she's putting on a show!

45:07.162 --> 45:10.874
She's the one behind all this.
Can't you see that I'm the victim?

45:10.958 --> 45:12.501
I'm the victim!

45:13.419 --> 45:15.421
[mom] Chi-ho, darling, please sit down.

45:15.504 --> 45:19.258
-It's all for show. It's just an act!
-Chi-ho, what are you doing? Sit down!

45:19.341 --> 45:22.428
-No! Mr. Lee, don't!
-Oh my God, Chi-ho! Come back here.

45:22.511 --> 45:25.431
I know you're okay.
There's nothing wrong with you.

45:26.014 --> 45:27.641
-[gasping]
-Get your hands off her!

45:27.725 --> 45:30.018
Tell them it's a lie.
Tell them you're putting on a show.

45:30.102 --> 45:32.855
[mom] It's like he said, it's an act.
It's all a lie!

45:32.938 --> 45:34.523
-[gasping]
-Let him go!

45:35.607 --> 45:37.317
Stop it! You're hurting him! Stop it!

45:37.401 --> 45:38.736
[whimpers]

45:39.236 --> 45:41.321
-Now you know how it feels.
-[groans]

45:41.405 --> 45:42.239
[gasps]

45:42.322 --> 45:45.993
Have you reflected on what you've done?
On the pain you've inflicted?

45:49.329 --> 45:51.623
Or do you want me to break your wrist
so you understand?

45:51.707 --> 45:53.208
-[groans]
-[mom] Oh my God!

45:53.292 --> 45:55.002
That's enough, Inspector Im.

45:56.503 --> 45:58.589
Chi-ho, are you all right? [gasps]

45:59.423 --> 46:01.216
The student you see standing before you

46:01.300 --> 46:03.886
is an undercover inspector
working for the ERPB,

46:03.969 --> 46:06.722
investigating the bullying
of Jang Seong-gu by Mr. Lee

46:06.805 --> 46:09.391
and other students from Jinwon High.

46:09.475 --> 46:10.642
[man] That explains it.

46:12.603 --> 46:15.105
[Hwa-jin] You're wondering why
we had to go to such lengths.

46:15.189 --> 46:18.734
It was necessary in order for us
to clear the name of Seong-gu.

46:22.988 --> 46:24.323
Hey, Seong-gu?

46:25.866 --> 46:27.493
You watching this?

46:33.165 --> 46:35.167
[poignant music plays]

46:38.837 --> 46:40.631
-[scoffs]
-[Hwa-jin] That's why we're here.

46:40.714 --> 46:44.426
Inspector Han-rim went undercover
to clear the name of an innocent student.

46:46.386 --> 46:48.263
So, Chi-ho, how does it feel?

46:49.264 --> 46:51.725
Maybe you've started to remember
what you did?

46:52.392 --> 46:53.644
How you bullied Seong-gu?

46:53.727 --> 46:56.355
You've no right to do this. It isn't fair!

46:57.606 --> 46:59.483
I never even laid a hand on Seong-gu.

46:59.566 --> 47:01.902
That's true. You didn't actually hit him.

47:02.528 --> 47:05.531
He doesn't have a single bruise.
That doesn't mean there wasn't violence.

47:06.907 --> 47:09.493
Despite the fact
that you never physically beat him,

47:10.619 --> 47:13.956
your behavior left him terrified,
abused, and traumatized.

47:14.039 --> 47:18.210
No matter what he tried, no one
believed him. Not a single word he said.

47:18.710 --> 47:20.796
Not even his own parents. Mm.

47:21.755 --> 47:24.883
He ended up believing
that he'd be better off getting beaten.

47:25.384 --> 47:27.427
Because if you could see the bruises,

47:29.179 --> 47:31.098
maybe his parents would believe him.

47:32.474 --> 47:34.434
You wanna know what the worst part is?

47:34.518 --> 47:36.728
To try to get out
of the dark hole he was in,

47:36.812 --> 47:40.858
he had no choice but to beg the punk
who put him there in the first place.

47:41.441 --> 47:44.152
He had to get down on his knees…

47:46.572 --> 47:48.866
and beg for mercy from his own bully.

47:48.949 --> 47:50.325
[breathes shakily]

47:50.409 --> 47:52.327
[Hwa-jin] That's how you humiliated him

47:52.995 --> 47:54.663
without even touching him.

47:57.249 --> 47:58.208
[crying]

47:58.292 --> 47:59.167
[sniffles]

48:01.420 --> 48:02.921
[sobs]

48:03.005 --> 48:04.339
It must have been so hard.

48:04.423 --> 48:05.924
[cries]

48:06.008 --> 48:08.427
It must have been
so hard for you all alone.

48:09.011 --> 48:11.346
Forgive me, please. I'm so sorry.

48:11.847 --> 48:15.851
It was my fault. I should have
believed you and listened to you.

48:15.934 --> 48:17.811
I should never have doubted you.

48:17.895 --> 48:19.605
[mom cries]

48:21.481 --> 48:25.319
Our investigation has proven
that Jang Seong-gu was bullied,

48:25.402 --> 48:27.738
and that Chi-ho has repeatedly lied
to this committee.

48:27.821 --> 48:29.239
Not only has he lied,

48:29.323 --> 48:31.533
but he also extorted
and preyed upon Seong-gu

48:31.617 --> 48:33.577
while claiming to be his good friend.

48:33.660 --> 48:35.203
As a result of our findings,

48:35.287 --> 48:39.291
the ERPB has decided to initiate immediate
protective measures for Seong-gu.

48:39.374 --> 48:40.208
[scoffs]

48:40.292 --> 48:43.295
The Bureau insists
that the school violence committee publish

48:44.212 --> 48:48.008
an official written letter,
an apology to the victim's mother.

48:50.969 --> 48:53.472
A victim is a victim. A bully is a bully.

48:53.555 --> 48:54.973
And a liar is a liar.

48:57.351 --> 48:59.436
Is that so hard to understand?

49:06.151 --> 49:08.445
We adults are here to protect children.

49:10.155 --> 49:12.074
You should be ashamed of yourself.

49:23.335 --> 49:24.836
Wow. Can't believe it worked.

49:34.012 --> 49:36.098
Thank you for all you've done for me.

49:36.181 --> 49:39.476
We'll make sure you get a new ID
and get your accounts back.

49:39.977 --> 49:43.438
Thank you so much, Inspector.
And thank you both for your help.

49:43.522 --> 49:45.732
-We wish you best of luck, ma'am.
-Thank you.

49:46.233 --> 49:47.818
I'll do the very best I can.

49:47.901 --> 49:50.362
[chuckles] Time for you
to go back home now.

49:50.445 --> 49:51.405
[Seong-gu] Goodbye.

49:56.868 --> 49:58.078
[music fades]

49:58.161 --> 50:00.372
-[mom] This is your friend?
-[Seong-gu] Yeah.

50:00.998 --> 50:03.041
-[Gyu-cheol chuckles]
-[Seong-gu sniffs]

50:14.094 --> 50:17.431
I wanted to apologize.
You told me not to get involved.

50:19.599 --> 50:23.854
But in the end, I'm really happy to see
that everything turned out well for him.

50:25.147 --> 50:26.148
It's good news.

50:48.295 --> 50:50.088
[man] Welcome. Good evening.

51:03.852 --> 51:05.896
No, that's not for you.

51:06.980 --> 51:08.523
That one's for Ga-yun.

51:31.254 --> 51:32.714
[Gang-seok groans]

51:35.550 --> 51:36.635
[Gang-seok sighs]

51:37.844 --> 51:38.804
[Gang-seok sighs]

51:39.971 --> 51:41.306
[Hwa-jin] Lie down here.

51:41.932 --> 51:43.892
-[Gang-seok grunts]
-[Hwa-jin] Careful.

51:43.975 --> 51:45.310
-[sighs]
-[Hwa-jin grunts]

51:46.436 --> 51:48.605
[Gang-seok groans]

51:59.366 --> 52:00.408
[Hwa-jin grunts]

52:03.662 --> 52:04.830
Hey.

52:06.748 --> 52:08.458
Get yourself another girlfriend.

52:09.543 --> 52:10.502
[chuckles]

52:11.962 --> 52:14.464
I'm not sure that Ga-yun would agree.

52:15.507 --> 52:17.425
Imagine if she found out that

52:19.386 --> 52:23.348
her own father had been
ranting on about that for hours, huh?

52:29.938 --> 52:31.815
[exhales, sniffs]

52:32.482 --> 52:33.775
[sighs]

52:47.664 --> 52:49.374
[Ga-yun] You're so busted!

52:49.875 --> 52:52.085
[poignant music plays]

52:52.169 --> 52:53.003
[chuckles]

52:57.299 --> 52:58.967
Fine. No more smoking, then.

53:16.026 --> 53:17.027
[cell phone buzzes]

53:28.580 --> 53:29.623
[Ga-yun] Come on.

53:30.248 --> 53:31.208
A toast!

53:31.291 --> 53:32.125
[music stops]

53:32.209 --> 53:34.753
Why would I want to share a drink
with this guy?

53:36.004 --> 53:38.298
I don't see the point
if he doesn't like me.

53:40.133 --> 53:41.092
[Hwa-jin sighs]

53:41.968 --> 53:45.096
[sighs] Are you both
gonna act like children?

53:45.597 --> 53:46.473
Absolutely.

53:46.556 --> 53:47.974
He leaves me no choice.

53:48.058 --> 53:49.601
[sighs]

53:50.560 --> 53:51.978
Well, I guess then,

53:52.687 --> 53:53.772
we won't get married.

53:55.232 --> 53:58.401
-What's gotten into you all of a sudden?
-It's a good idea.

53:58.485 --> 54:00.946
Good, we all agree.
I'm never getting married.

54:02.197 --> 54:03.156
Never ever?

54:03.240 --> 54:04.074
Mm-hmm.

54:04.157 --> 54:08.328
Well, if I can't marry Hwa-jin, then
I'll just live alone, grow old and die.

54:08.411 --> 54:12.249
And you, my dear father,
will never, ever hold your grandchildren,

54:12.332 --> 54:15.752
and never hear their voices
call for their grandfather.

54:16.253 --> 54:20.465
If you don't want that to happen,
I suggest you reconsider your behavior.

54:20.548 --> 54:23.635
Well, maybe… I can reconsider.

54:24.636 --> 54:28.848
Good. In that case, I'd say
it's time we raised our glasses together.

54:30.600 --> 54:32.269
-Shall we toast?
-[laughs]

54:32.352 --> 54:33.687
How about an arm-and-arm toast?

54:33.770 --> 54:35.480
You might be pushing your luck.

54:35.563 --> 54:38.024
Well, then, no grandchildren.
Recording. Ready?

54:38.108 --> 54:39.150
-That's not fair--
-Wait.

54:39.234 --> 54:40.360
-One…
-Give me a minute, okay.

54:40.443 --> 54:42.112
-Two…
-Okay.

54:42.195 --> 54:44.447
Three. Yeah!

54:44.531 --> 54:45.573
[Ga-yun laughs]

54:45.657 --> 54:48.910
♪ The light is dim ♪

54:49.536 --> 54:52.706
♪ But I'm not afraid ♪

54:53.832 --> 54:56.626
♪ I've lived enough ♪

54:56.710 --> 55:00.046
♪ I know it's my fate ♪

55:01.506 --> 55:04.134
♪ A quiet voice ♪

55:04.968 --> 55:07.554
♪ Is calling me ♪

55:09.055 --> 55:11.808
♪ From afar ♪

55:13.101 --> 55:15.854
♪ From afar ♪

55:18.231 --> 55:23.236
♪ To where the endless sky
Meets the sea… ♪

55:25.155 --> 55:26.197
[cries]

55:26.281 --> 55:31.578
♪ To where the echoes fade away ♪

55:34.539 --> 55:38.251
♪ I've given all I had to give ♪

55:38.335 --> 55:41.755
♪ Now I'll find the space… ♪

55:41.838 --> 55:42.797
[Gang-seok sobs]

55:42.881 --> 55:48.470
♪ Where my peace belongs ♪

55:50.722 --> 55:54.225
♪ I'll fade into ♪

55:55.018 --> 55:58.438
♪ Forever ♪

55:58.938 --> 56:05.028
♪ With no regret ♪

56:10.700 --> 56:11.659
[music fades]

56:12.535 --> 56:13.953
[Chi-ho] What the fuck, man?

56:14.537 --> 56:15.372
Hey!

56:16.122 --> 56:16.956
Fuck!

56:18.750 --> 56:22.545
I'd win, that's what you told me.
You said I'd win if I hired a lawyer.

56:27.425 --> 56:32.055
-You should be first to file a report.
-Why would I bother? What for?

56:32.764 --> 56:35.225
You cannot afford
to be complacent right now.

56:36.476 --> 56:40.730
The ERPB will do everything that it can
to brand you as the school bully.

56:41.231 --> 56:42.941
They'll try to have you suspended.

56:43.024 --> 56:46.027
Or even have you expelled from the school.

56:46.111 --> 56:47.695
[suspenseful music plays]

56:50.281 --> 56:52.200
You need to make the first move.

56:53.159 --> 56:56.413
Because in today's world,
the victim is the one who files first.

56:57.038 --> 57:00.333
If you don't want to be branded a bully,
then play the victim.

57:01.543 --> 57:02.961
Call him. He'll help you.

57:03.461 --> 57:04.921
ATTORNEY YOON TAE-GYEONG

57:06.047 --> 57:07.424
[Chi-ho] What do we do now?

57:08.883 --> 57:10.885
Everything has gone exactly as planned.

57:10.969 --> 57:12.303
Jeez, come on!

57:13.096 --> 57:15.265
What the fuck are you talking about, huh?

57:15.348 --> 57:16.474
[sighs]

57:17.225 --> 57:18.268
Listen, dude,

57:18.351 --> 57:20.854
my life's over because of the ERPB.

57:21.438 --> 57:22.981
And my family's screwed because of me.

57:23.064 --> 57:25.859
And the only fucking way out of this
is if I'm dead!

57:25.942 --> 57:27.569
[breathes heavily]

57:27.652 --> 57:30.363
What the fuck do you mean,
it's gone as planned, huh?

57:31.239 --> 57:33.908
I'm the one who reported you
for bullying Seong-gu.

57:34.409 --> 57:36.161
That's why the Bureau came after you.

57:37.704 --> 57:39.247
Wanna know what happens next?

57:40.999 --> 57:41.916
This.

57:42.000 --> 57:43.209
[grunts]

57:44.294 --> 57:45.128
[body thuds]

57:45.211 --> 57:47.213
[somber music plays]

57:49.924 --> 57:52.135
[Gyu-cheol breathes deeply]

57:52.927 --> 57:54.637
MIRAE DAEHAN PARTY

57:54.721 --> 57:55.680
[knocking on door]

57:55.763 --> 57:57.265
Excuse me, sir.

57:59.976 --> 58:01.144
Did you see the news?

58:01.644 --> 58:03.605
The ERPB is in serious trouble.

58:03.688 --> 58:06.024
There was an incident
during their latest investigation.

58:08.485 --> 58:09.444
[knocking on door]

58:11.404 --> 58:14.199
-Sir, you have a visitor.
-[Gi-tae] Show them in.

58:15.366 --> 58:17.368
Oh! [chuckles]

58:17.452 --> 58:20.163
What brings you here
so early this morning? Huh?

58:21.498 --> 58:22.749
Hm. Please, have a seat.

58:22.832 --> 58:23.958
Thanks.

58:24.042 --> 58:26.085
Miss, can you bring us some tea please.

58:27.003 --> 58:27.921
[woman] Yes, sir.

58:28.671 --> 58:30.215
[Gi-tae] So, Cho Gyu-cheol,

58:30.757 --> 58:33.551
shouldn't you be on your way to school
at this time?

58:33.635 --> 58:37.597
Well, I have something I need to give you.
After that, I'll be on my way.

58:37.680 --> 58:40.725
It wouldn't look good
for me to miss school.

58:43.269 --> 58:45.688
[Chi-ho] My life's over
because of the ERPB.

58:46.189 --> 58:48.107
And my family's screwed because of me.

58:48.191 --> 58:51.027
And the only fucking way out of this
is if I'm dead!

58:52.654 --> 58:54.864
And what is this recording?

58:55.949 --> 58:56.950
It's what you wanted.

59:00.036 --> 59:03.206
Um, there's no need to worry.
There were no cameras.

59:07.335 --> 59:09.587
It's not that I don't trust you, sir.

59:10.296 --> 59:12.924
It's up to you to decide
what you want to do with it.

59:21.891 --> 59:24.561
STUDENT FALLS FROM JINWON HIGH ROOFTOP
SUICIDE SUSPECTED

59:24.644 --> 59:25.895
[tense music plays]

59:25.979 --> 59:26.813
Hang on.

59:28.481 --> 59:30.775
What the hell do you think you're doing?

59:31.359 --> 59:33.528
Do you think
I got you out of jail for this?

59:35.071 --> 59:35.989
Ah.

59:37.156 --> 59:38.199
You don't get it.

59:40.910 --> 59:42.662
But you didn't get me out of jail.

59:44.247 --> 59:46.541
You see, I planned all of this.

59:49.877 --> 59:50.712
What?

59:50.795 --> 59:53.381
You're not the one
who dragged me into this.

59:53.464 --> 59:55.383
I'm the one who dragged you into it.

59:56.050 --> 59:58.678
It was me
who sent Officer Kang to see you.

01:00:17.155 --> 01:00:18.239
PAROLE REVIEW MATERIALS

01:00:20.033 --> 01:00:22.535
DEEMED SUITABLE FOR SOCIAL REINTEGRATION
THROUGH PAROLE

01:00:23.453 --> 01:00:24.370
[gasps]

01:00:26.539 --> 01:00:29.083
It's true, sir, that by pulling strings
with the parole board,

01:00:29.167 --> 01:00:32.503
it really helped me get released,
and for that I'm very thankful.

01:00:34.005 --> 01:00:35.048
You piece of shit!

01:00:35.131 --> 01:00:36.049
[chuckles]

01:00:37.884 --> 01:00:39.510
You should mind your language.

01:00:39.594 --> 01:00:42.597
If you want to become president,
you'll need better manners.

01:00:44.432 --> 01:00:47.226
At the end of the day,
you and I want the same thing.

01:00:47.727 --> 01:00:50.104
We both want to see the end of the ERPB.

01:00:51.356 --> 01:00:52.482
[exhales]

01:01:00.615 --> 01:01:01.616
[door opens]

01:01:04.494 --> 01:01:05.536
[door closes]

01:01:06.245 --> 01:01:07.288
[sighs]

01:01:07.872 --> 01:01:08.915
[sighs]

01:01:22.428 --> 01:01:23.513
[music fades]

01:01:23.596 --> 01:01:26.516
Minister, have you any updates
concerning Lee Chi-ho's progress?

01:01:27.100 --> 01:01:28.810
Have you had the opportunity to see him?

01:01:28.893 --> 01:01:30.978
[reporter] Congressman,
are you here to see Mr. Lee?

01:01:31.062 --> 01:01:34.232
Any comments concerning
recent events at Jinwon High?

01:01:36.150 --> 01:01:38.528
Congressman, what brings you here,
may I ask?

01:01:38.611 --> 01:01:42.198
The country is in uproar
after this incident. How could I not come?

01:01:42.281 --> 01:01:44.200
[camera shutters click]

01:01:44.283 --> 01:01:47.453
Right now, his health is the priority.
You should leave.

01:01:47.537 --> 01:01:50.832
You're not really in a position to tell me
what I should be doing, Minister.

01:01:57.922 --> 01:01:58.840
[recorder beeps]

01:01:58.923 --> 01:02:01.592
[Chi-ho] My life's over
because of the ERPB.

01:02:01.676 --> 01:02:03.636
And my family's screwed because of me.

01:02:03.720 --> 01:02:06.305
And the only fucking way out of this
is if I'm dead!

01:02:09.016 --> 01:02:10.935
Do you really think, Minister,

01:02:11.436 --> 01:02:14.188
that the ERPB has no responsibility
for what happened?

01:02:17.984 --> 01:02:21.028
[reporter] A shocking audio recording
from a Jinwon High School student

01:02:21.112 --> 01:02:23.781
who is believed to have attempted suicide
is spreading online.

01:02:23.865 --> 01:02:26.951
The five-second recording,
which is gaining considerable traction

01:02:27.034 --> 01:02:28.244
and attention on social media,

01:02:28.327 --> 01:02:32.498
appears to capture the student's own voice
expressing resentment towards the ERPB.

01:02:32.999 --> 01:02:36.586
Police are focusing their investigation
on the authenticity of the recording

01:02:36.669 --> 01:02:40.047
and are seeking to determine
who made it and how it was distributed.

01:02:40.131 --> 01:02:44.010
The political world has reacted swiftly
and is calling for an emergency review

01:02:44.093 --> 01:02:46.763
to determine whether there were
any illegal acts or coercion

01:02:46.846 --> 01:02:49.682
during the ERPB's investigation process.

01:02:49.766 --> 01:02:50.933
JINWON HIGH SCHOOL

01:02:51.017 --> 01:02:53.019
[suspenseful music plays]

01:03:04.739 --> 01:03:06.449
[suspenseful music builds]

01:03:50.076 --> 01:03:52.203
♪ I'm gonna hunt you down ♪

01:03:52.787 --> 01:03:54.747
♪ Yeah, I ain't playing around ♪

01:03:55.414 --> 01:03:57.041
♪ I'mma take your crown ♪

01:03:57.124 --> 01:04:00.336
♪ Man, better run, gonna hunt you down
Let's go ♪

01:04:00.837 --> 01:04:02.255
♪ Who's the bravest? ♪

01:04:02.755 --> 01:04:05.842
♪ Let me know
How far you wanna take this ♪

01:04:05.925 --> 01:04:07.844
♪ I've been having dreams of winning ♪

01:04:07.927 --> 01:04:10.096
♪ I can see myself
In an esteemed position ♪

01:04:10.179 --> 01:04:12.181
♪ I got no qualms, I got no fears ♪

01:04:12.265 --> 01:04:14.183
♪ I got blood, sweat and tears
Under my belt ♪

01:04:14.267 --> 01:04:16.686
♪ And now I'm switching gears
And there's no stopping ♪

01:04:16.769 --> 01:04:18.187
♪ You got no options ♪

01:04:18.271 --> 01:04:21.357
♪ We win by any means necessary
You got it? ♪

01:04:27.405 --> 01:04:30.074
-♪ I'm gonna hunt you down ♪
-♪ Gonna hunt you down ♪

01:04:30.157 --> 01:04:32.702
-♪ Yeah, I ain't playing around ♪
-♪ I ain't playing around ♪

01:04:32.785 --> 01:04:34.203
♪ I'mma take your crown ♪

01:04:34.287 --> 01:04:37.206
♪ Man, better run, gonna hunt you down ♪

01:04:37.290 --> 01:04:40.209
♪ Uh, yeah, I be coming for you
Like Hannibal ♪

01:04:40.293 --> 01:04:42.712
♪ Uh, I'm a killer, call me a cannibal ♪

01:04:42.795 --> 01:04:45.214
♪ Uh, I'mma take your crown ♪

01:04:45.298 --> 01:04:47.800
♪ Man, better run, gonna hunt you down ♪

01:04:52.305 --> 01:04:53.556
[music stops]
